o frequency services, including single cell function tests and single site/cluster verification tests; drive test analysis; analysing voice over long-term evolution performance; investigating and resolving dropped call issues; conducting interference analysis to identify and mitigate signal disruptions; evaluating traffic patterns; and identifying and analyzing worst-performing cells for targeted optimization and improvement. In addition, the company provides engineering procurement construction management services comprising designing projects, sourcing materials and equipment, and managing construction processes. Further, it offers operations and maintenance services; technology solutions; manpower outsourcing and payrolling services; civil contracting, electrical contracting, and mechanical contracting services; and charging solutions. The company was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in Kolkata, India.","employees":3432,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795784369},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795784368,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Steelman Telecom\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Steelman Telecom allots 7.86 lakh warrants to promoters on preferential basis","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795594003,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNZHFPRUFUTmRiUkRkV180MUpPTlYxcF9LRXFBaUZxSDlGc2pyNVZmSk1xMkFYeTR3aDNwZG9DeEV0cjh0QjlTYzFqU1djWlF4Vnd1c004YUdYRzRKQTZOZW8zb1FuTFcwb3RqRjJ6aDlsZFI0Sk5PbG54UTJRb3p6ZnRtVzVGV3FsZU9jQlpkYkhLNy02ZzkxMWN1V0VNMFJoMkE1cUFfcXlyUUxJZ2lpSzFDZFkzb29mRUhGUlNOUQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"BSE grants in-principle approval for Steelman Telecom warrant issue","s":"scanx.trade","d":1794816000,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNR2Z0WUVBZk9MMUM5WThOcm54TGVQel82UmN1eTl5dDhMOTUzQlZ5SkUyZnNaNW1DUjhvMUxPd0xuQmxYNExwY2VuQm10OGNFV3BhLUVmV3VMZmJ0TkRlU0wtUFdDVm12Zy1pTHBaVUtjMHdaRTF3R19PalRwS3VGUmJIRkVUNzZnbUNOT0FwR3FKREgtZ2ht